{"content":[{"c":["ESHTEMOA, ESHTEMOH (P",{"c":["lace"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["City south of Jerusalem allotted to Judah when Palestine was divided among the 12 tribes (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.50","r":"Josh.15.50","rawR":"Josh.15.50","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.50","value":"Josh.15.50"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:50"},"). Eshtemoa was assigned to the Levites (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.14","r":"Josh.21.14","rawR":"Josh.21.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.14","value":"Josh.21.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 21:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.57","r":"1Chr.6.57","rawR":"1Chr.6.57","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.57","value":"1Chr.6.57"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:57"},"). After an Amalekite victory, David sent booty to his allies in Eshtemoa (",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.30.26-31","r":"1Sam.30.26-31","rawR":"1Sam.30.26-31","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.30.26-31","value":"1Sam.30.26-31"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Sm 30:26-31"},"). The site may be modern al-Samu’a, eight miles (13 kilometers) south of Hebron."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Levitical Cities"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"EshtemoaEshtemohPlace","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:50","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.50","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.50","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.50"},{"anchorText":"Jos 21:14","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.14","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.14","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.14"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:57","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.57","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.57","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.57"},{"anchorText":"1 Sm 30:26-31","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.30.26-31","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.30.26-31","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.30.26-31"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"eae495ab3245b095820e759ad10beacceb8eb95f7b127882041bf2a01178965c","sourceItemName":"EshtemoaEshtemohPlace","sourceItemOrder":245,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"EshtemoaEshtemohPlace","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Eshtemoa, Eshtemoh (Place)","title":"Eshtemoa, Eshtemoh (Place)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}